GPUI Fast compatibility distribution

Derived from the immutable crates.io GPUI Fast 0.1.12 family, as pinned by
GPUI Kit 0.8.1 at 18be16887bc2cb462f7b0a33c18bf6183344e7de:
https://github.com/longbridge/gpui-kit
https://github.com/longbridge/gpui-fast

The release archives were verified against the registry checksums recorded
in the upstream Kit lockfile. Their original Cargo.toml.orig manifests are used as Cargo.toml; source
files and upstream Apache-2.0 licenses are retained. Package-local release
lockfiles are omitted because the consumer workspace owns resolution.

Sailry contributors preserve the reviewed AppKit descendant hit-test change
from aa12fda8c18c5b8fb1a0b2ff16650cf138908b8b in
https://github.com/dux-web/gpui-fast. The overlay first delegates visibility,
clipping and descendant selection to NSView, then filters only the overlay
itself through its GPUI input regions. No other production source delta is
applied to the immutable 0.1.12 release archives.

See LICENSE and each package's LICENSE and LICENSE-APACHE.
